# models/ and *.zip used to be ignored here — un-ignored 2026-08-19 so the
# trained checkpoints (9.2MB total, largest file 8MB — well within GitHub's
# limits, no LFS needed) are actually part of the backup. Without this, a
# fresh clone of the repo has a dashboard that starts but silently loses the
# LSTM/NN/RL model-comparison and RL-strategy features (main.py catches
# FileNotFoundError and just omits them).
